      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A sprite sheet of 16 separate game item icons arranged in a strict 4 by 4 grid, one object centered in each equal square cell, generous empty space between objects, every object fully inside its own cell, nothing touching or overlapping, no grid lines, no text, no labels, no shadows on the ground. Flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF) everywhere. 16-bit pixel art game sprites in a cohesive sci-fi 'Neo-Terra' style: chunky readable silhouettes, dark outlines, limited palette with metallic greys, deep blues and glowing cyan/amber accents, soft top-left lighting, crisp pixels, no anti-aliased blur. Every object is a different, distinct design that matches its own name and description: vary the silhouette, materials and details between cells; never repeat the same shape in another colour. Objects, left to right, top to bottom: 1. Headlamp: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 2. Kinetic plate Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 3. Miner's gauntlet: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 4. Sprint servos Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 5. Angler's visor: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 6. Ballistics emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, ranged accent colours. 7. Barb mesh: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 8. Capacitor bank: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 9. Close-quarters emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, melee accent colours. 10. Command emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, command accent colours. 11. Coral pendant: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, coral pink colours. 12. Extender arm: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 13. Geo-scanner: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 14. Grav anchor: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 15. Grav damper: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 16. Hydro skimmers: a small wearable gadget or charm icon.",
        "",
        384
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "A sprite sheet of 16 separate game item icons arranged in a strict 4 by 4 grid, one object centered in each equal square cell, generous empty space between objects, every object fully inside its own cell, nothing touching or overlapping, no grid lines, no text, no labels, no shadows on the ground. Flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF) everywhere. 16-bit pixel art game sprites in a cohesive sci-fi 'Neo-Terra' style: chunky readable silhouettes, dark outlines, limited palette with metallic greys, deep blues and glowing cyan/amber accents, soft top-left lighting, crisp pixels, no anti-aliased blur. Every object is a different, distinct design that matches its own name and description: vary the silhouette, materials and details between cells; never repeat the same shape in another colour. Objects, left to right, top to bottom: 1. Headlamp: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 2. Kinetic plate Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 3. Miner's gauntlet: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 4. Sprint servos Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 5. Angler's visor: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 6. Ballistics emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, ranged accent colours. 7. Barb mesh: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 8. Capacitor bank: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 9. Close-quarters emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, melee accent colours. 10. Command emblem Mk I: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, command accent colours. 11. Coral pendant: a small wearable gadget or charm icon, coral pink colours. 12. Extender arm: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 13. Geo-scanner: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 14. Grav anchor: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 15. Grav damper: a small wearable gadget or charm icon. 16. Hydro skimmers: a small wearable gadget or charm icon.",
